    {
      "id": "key-text",
      "shape": "text",
      "role": "label",
      "face": "body",
      "text": "Blue: the executable. Grey: other files. Outlines group directories.\nThe file group lists separate files relative to share/ravel/examples.\nThe CLI starts the same bin/ravel as a separate Rhai worker and checks its identity.\nThe worker is a process role, not another installed executable.\nThe owner copies and edits the examples. sample.rhai and llm.rhai import static.rhai.\nInstalled execution needs no separate language runtime or source checkout.\nTHIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md lists notices for Rust dependencies.\nRelease archives additionally carry README.md and LICENSE at their root.",
      "x": 320.1796875,
      "y": 562.38125,
